Read CLAUDE.md in the repository root before changing anything. It is the canonical
standing-instructions file for this project and applies to every agent and tool.

THE PORTAL DESIGN IS LOCKED. Navigation is a LEFT SIDEBAR (.p-sidebar in
src/app/portal/portal.css) — sticky, 15.5rem, full height, translucent with a
backdrop blur, collapsing to a left drawer behind a Menu button below 1024px. The
aesthetic is modern, sleek and smooth: dark glass cards (18px radius, inset top
highlight) over a warm radial ambient glow, 999px pill nav links and buttons, a
double-ringed avatar, accent focus rings.

Do NOT convert the nav to a top bar. Do NOT flatten the cards. Do NOT "harmonise" the
literal radii back to the marketing site's --radius-* tokens. Do NOT redesign,
simplify or modernise the portal. Build new features inside this language.

Diff before you write: more than one agent works in this repo. Hash the files you
intend to touch against what is on disk, adopt anything newer you did not write, and
merge your change into it.

Real facts only — never invent a phone number, address, award, review, price or
dietary claim. Every price is a placeholder pending client confirmation. "R." is part
of Chef R. Kearse's name and brand; never ask what it stands for.

Every animation needs a prefers-reduced-motion off-ramp. No emoji anywhere in the
product — icons come from src/components/portal/Icons.tsx.

Bars: npx tsc --noEmit (0 errors), npx next lint (0 warnings), npm run build
(0 warnings), and the five scripts in package.json / CLAUDE.md §3 all passing,
including qa-portal.mjs reporting "No failures." at 1023px and 1024px — the two
widths either side of the sidebar breakpoint.
